    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Sighting in. The phrase carries much significance in archery, a sport of concentration and mental practice. Exposing oneself to emotional vulnerability in social situations and relationships takes courage, as no one wishes to be a target. Finally, identifying the right kinds of charity when it comes to global philanthropy is an important and pressing issue in today's ever-changing and disparate world. These topics are explored in-depth over the course of this podcast.",
